                                "sense_id": "3c449658-5e54-3a95-9f6b-81038abacc5a",
                                "text": "In the afternoon the British held athletic sports, an impromptu military tournament, and a gymkhana, all of which caused much merriment and diversion, and the Boers profited by the cessation of the shell fire to shovel away at their trenches."
